{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fea595a9-0b5a-832d-bbcd-7f9d4f0bc507",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T13:08:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Deirdre Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:05:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Lorraine. Good afternoon. My name is Deirdre Lynch, and I have a few notes written down here so I get this right. I'm calling about trash and recycling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:06:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, first, bear with me, I'm peeling an orange for my lunch. The smell is just wonderful, it's filling the whole kitchen, so if I sound distracted, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:06:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that sounds nice for a Tuesday afternoon. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So my note says there's a neighbor who keeps leaving trash bags at the corner near my house. Not in a bin, just dumped in a pile on the corner. It's been about a week now, and the bags are starting to get torn open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:06:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so bags left loose on a corner, not at someone's curb. Let me get the location. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 108 Van Zandt Avenue, in the North End. The pile is at the corner right beside my property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One oh eight Van Zandt Avenue. Got it. Is that on your side of the street, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:06:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my side, right at the corner. And the second thing on my note is my recycling bin. It cracked down the side when the truck emptied it. I'd like to know how to request a replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:07:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. For a replacement bin, we'll put in a request with your address. Is it the blue recycling bin that's cracked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:07:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the blue one. The lid is fine, it's just the side that split."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So I'll take down a request for a new blue bin at 108 Van Zandt, and I'll send the corner dumping over to the crew that handles those pickups. Can I have a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:07:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. It's four zero one, five five five, zero one six zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four zero one, five five five, zero one six zero. Perfect. In the meantime, if you can, leave the cracked bin at the curb on your regular day so they can see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do that. I'll write it on my note. Thank you, Lorraine, you've been very helpful."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:08:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Lynch. Enjoy the orange."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:08:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I will. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
